\item[S3] S. Lepsveridze and Y. Sun, Size of the largest sum-free subset of [n]\textasciicircum{}3, [n]\textasciicircum{}4, and [n]\textasciicircum{}5, arXiv:2311.18289 (2023). \url{https://arxiv.org/abs/2311.18289}. Bibliographic information imported from the supplied record.

\item[S4] S. Lepsveridze and Y. Sun, Size of the Largest Sum-Free Subset of [n]\textasciicircum{}3 and [n]\textasciicircum{}4, IMRN (2026). \url{https://doi.org/10.1093/imrn/rnag081}. Bibliographic information imported from the supplied record.

